    {
      "source": "Start creating new <a href=\"ConditionalOperators.Cond.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ConditionalOperators.Cond</code></a> by providing the <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> used in <code>if</code>.",
