    {
      "source": "Encapsulates the aggregation framework <code>$cond</code> operator. A <a href=\"ConditionalOperators.Cond.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ConditionalOperators.Cond</code></a> allows nested conditions\n<code>if-then[if-then-else]-else</code> using <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a>, <a href=\"../query/CriteriaDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition</code></a>, <a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a>\nor a <code>custom</code> condition. Replacement values can be either <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>field references</code></a>,\n<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>expressions</code></a>, values of simple MongoDB types or values that can be converted to a\nsimple MongoDB type.",
      "translation": "封装了聚合框架中的 `$cond` 操作符。<a href=\"ConditionalOperators.Cond.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ConditionalOperators.Cond</code></a> 允许使用 <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Field</code></a>、<a href=\"../query/CriteriaDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition</code></a>、<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>AggregationExpression</code></a> 或自定义条件来嵌套 <code>if-then[if-then-else]-else</code> 逻辑。替换值可以是 <a href=\"Field.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>字段引用</code></a>、<a href=\"AggregationExpression.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>表达式</code></a>、简单的 MongoDB 类型值，或可转换为简单 MongoDB 类型的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
